OL,3,GNEWSAGigantic Halloween monsters to
OL,4,Atake over Lincoln
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincoln will be invaded by inflatable
OL,7,Fmonsters ahead of a week of Halloween
OL,8,Fcelebrations.
OL,10,FThe 23ft-tall (7m) monsters will be
OL,11,Ftaking over rooftops across the city
OL,12,Funtil 1 November and will be
OL,13,Filluminated at night so
OL,14,Ftrick-or-treaters can see them after
OL,15,Fdark.
OL,17,FIt is one of a number of Halloween
OL,18,Fevents in the city centre and local
OL,19,Fparks, including parades from a "family
OL,20,Fof phantoms" along Bailgate, Eastgate
OL,21,Fand Minster Yard on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
