OL,3,GNEWSAGigantic Halloween monsters to
OL,4,Atake over Lincoln
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ghostly figures will pass through
OL,7,Fthe streets "in illuminated, vibrant
OL,8,Fflowing capes, moving together like a
OL,9,Fdrifting cloud", according to organiser
OL,10,FLincoln BIG.
